+Block Mesh Alpha Rendering is part of the Exolands project, an open-source voxel game engine [S1, unofficial]. It was developed to provide efficient rendering of transparent blocks (like glass or water) in a WebGL-based voxel environment. The technique is described in the project's source code and documentation [S1, unofficial].
 
